<title>MEXICO: Gulf storm keep two Mexico crude ports shut - ports.</title>
<headline>Gulf storm keep two Mexico crude ports shut - ports.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Violent storms in the Gulf of Mexico kept two of Mexico's main crude ports shut from over the weekend, while Cayo Arcas crude port reopened early Monday, port officials said.</p>
<p>Cayo Arcas in Campeche state reopened at 0720 local/1220 GMT Monday after shutting at 1920 local Saturday.</p>
<p>Mexico's two other main crude ports, Dos Bocas and Pajaritos, remained shut Monday after also closing Saturday afternoon, officials told Reuters.</p>
